repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/interactor-taskweft-persona
abstract: >-
  A persona that answers from a planning domain instead of a neural network. It
  requires the RECTGTN planner as a Lean library and composes its answer in the
  planner's own GTN space: a domain declares state variables, a codebook
  vocabulary and actions, a goal names a node, and the answer is the plan that
  reaches it or a refusal by name. The vocabulary is a residual-FSQ-shaped
  codebook, so a few small integers name a very large set of categories.
